o be the next book after Terra Verde, but they ended the line before that, so the manuscript was released for free.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-23T12:27:00-08:00","id":1547204,"title":"","content":"I found the following books on the internet:<br /> <br /> Brainwaves<br /> The New Flesh<br /> <br /> I also found the following topic on this forum.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/427250-post-publishing-and-fan-made-materials\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/427250-post-publishing-and-fan-made-materials\"> Post-publishing and fan-made materials - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/427250-post-publishing-and-fan-made-materials\"> https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/427250-post-publishing-and-fan-made-materials </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Greetings all. I just wanted to see what resources for the trinity/continuum universe might fall out if i gave the tree a shake. My inspiration here is to track </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26918,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26918-someperson","user":"SomePerson","date":". 12-23-2024, 03:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26918-someperson","name":"SomePerson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-29T05:05:54-08:00","id":1547300,"title":"","content":"If it helps and other sources have dried, I have a collection of the following Aberrant 1ed. fan-made and semi-official supplements in my personal archive:<br /> <br /> 3rd World War<br /> A Breed Apart<br /> Brainwaves<br /> Compendium<br /> Forceful Personalities<br /> Nexus<br /> Novatech<br /> The New Flesh<br /> Underworld<br /> <br /> However, it seems from that topic that I still missed a few items. How well, nobody and no fan is perfect. Moreover, I cared very little for the canon metaplot and for Trinity and Adventure, except for completist reasons and reference for Aberrant, so I was much less diligent in collecting their fan-made stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1949,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","user":"Irioth","date":". 12-29-2024, 08:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","name":"Irioth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"566"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-29T08:34:14-08:00","id":1547306,"title":"","content":"Where can I find the 3rd World War? I remember there were references to it in the old Eon Site, but I never got my hands on it<br /> <br /> Edit: dot it in one of the links in the referenced post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Insp